WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.900
<v Arthur>Don't panic, the towel is
still the most important item.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.900
<v Arthur>The answer to life, the universe
and everything is forty-two.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.900
<v Speaker 2>Marvin says the improbability drive
makes him even more depressed.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.900
<v Speaker 2>Vogon poetry is the third
worst in the known universe.

